  "zh": "# AI短剧争议、电诈转移、航班事故、国内热点多，今日热点聚焦AI产业、国际安全与中国社会动态\n## AI与科技\n- **AI短剧销量神话被质疑**：红果日活1.68亿AI短剧可能只赚一块钱，商业模式存疑\n- **DeepSeek Agent小白教程发布**：AI工具生态进一步扩展，开发者活跃度提升\n## 行业动向\n- **电诈园区从柬埔寨转移到马达加斯加**：犯罪链条扩大，执法挑战加剧\n- **Lenovo加密指纹驱动器被揭穿**：实际仅为未加密SD卡，安全隐患被放大\n## 民生与国际\n- **美公务机坠毁9人遇难**：国际航空安全事件引发全球关注\n- **中国首次载人登月第一句话讨论**：国家科技成就引发国内外热议\n## 开发者圈\n- **GPT 6.2 Astra灰测结果公布**：AI模型性能评估为行业提供参考\n- **DSH团队发布Super-agent**：智能体技术取得新突破，推动AI应用深化",
  "en": "AI short-form video controversy, fraud migration, plane crashes, and domestic events dominate today's trends\n## AI & Tech\n- **AI short-form video myth questioned**: RedPanda's 1.68B short-form video DAU may only earn a few dollars, business model is suspect\n- **DeepSeek Agent beginner guide released**: AI tool ecosystem expands further, developer activity rises\n## Industry Trends\n- **Fraud hub moves from Cambodia to Madagascar**: Criminal network expands, law enforcement challenges intensify\n- **Lenovo encrypted fingerprint drive exposed**: Actually just an unencrypted SD card in a case, security risks amplified\n## Social & International\n- **Commercial jet crash kills 9**: International aviation safety incident sparks global concern\n- **First Chinese crewed lunar landing first words debated**: National tech achievement ignites domestic and international discussion\n## Developer Circle\n- **GPT 6.2 Astra stress test results published**: AI model performance evaluation provides industry reference\n- **DSH team releases Super-agent**: Agentic technology achieves new breakthrough, advancing AI applications"
